'''Brewnall Village''' is a tiny [[Dwarf|dwarven]] village established in [[Chill Breeze Valley]], near [[Gnomeregan]]. It serves as a home for the [[Barleybrew]]s, who constantly work to experiment and improve on the venerable dwarven beer brewing tradition. The Barleybrews send young dwarves out on missions to protect the village from wild animals<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|8|A Favor for Evershine}}</ref> and seek out secret ingredients for the ultimate ale.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|9|The Perfect Stout}}</ref>

==Inhabitants==
* {{NPC|Alliance|Rejold Barleybrew|icon=Dwarf Male}}
* {{NPC|Alliance|Marleth Barleybrew|icon=Dwarf Female}}
* {{NPC|Alliance|Burdrak Harglhelm|Leather Armor Merchant|icon=Dwarf Male}}
* {{NPC|Alliance|Keeg Gibn|Ale & Wine|icon=Dwarf Male}}
* {{NPC|Alliance|Gretta Ganter|Fishing Supplies|icon=Dwarf Female}} (outside)
* {{NPC|Alliance|Tristane Shadowstone|icon=Dwarf Female}}
* {{NPC|Alliance|Dun Morogh Mountaineer|icon=Dwarf Male|icon2=Dwarf Female}}

==Notes==
* Despite being affiliated with the dwarven kingdom of [[Ironforge (kingdom)|Ironforge]], the village is located in the gnomish territory part of [[Dun Morogh]].
* Despite being called a village, the location has no actual buildings and seems more like a camp.

